// 004 - Linux authentication events from Syslog
// Purpose : See SSH logins, sudo use and failed passwords on Linux servers.
// Source  : Syslog (Azure Monitor Agent + data collection rule, Arc-connected Ubuntu)
// MITRE   : T1110 Brute Force, T1078 Valid Accounts, T1548.003 Sudo
// Tuning  : Admin sudo use is normal; look for failures in bursts or logins at odd hours.
Syslog
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where Facility in ("auth", "authpriv")
| summarize Events = count(), LastEvent = max(TimeGenerated) by Computer, Facility, ProcessName
| sort by Events desc
